OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APontins fined #1m after grandmother's
OL,4,Adeath
OL,5,
OL,6,FJones' son James Havard-Jones said:
OL,7,F"There is a temptation to describe what
OL,8,Fhappened as an accident. I cannot do
OL,9,Fthat. An accident is something
OL,10,Funforeseeable. This was not
OL,11,Funforeseeable. This was preventable."
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
